        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {H [ f (t - t _ {0}) ]} & {= f (\\frac {t}{2} - t _ {0}) \\textcircled {3}} \\\\ {y (t - t _ {0})} & {= f (\\frac {t - t _ {0}}{2}) \\textcircled {4}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            213,
