    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4、【2024年华东理工大学1.2】已知某系统的输入输出关系为",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            677,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny (t) = f (2 t) + f (t - 1)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            400,
            131,
            594,
            150
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "判断该系统是否是线性、时不变、因果、无记忆性、稳定系统。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            155,
            685,
            173
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "反应作用: [让液后中 $t \\rightarrow  {2t}$ ] + [让液后中 $t \\rightarrow  {t - 1}$ ]",
        "bbox": [
            176,
            169,
            707,
            218
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {H [ a _ {1} f _ {1} (t) + a _ {2} f _ {2} (t) ]} & {= [ a _ {1} f _ {1} (t) + a _ {2} f _ {2} (t) ] + [ a _ {1} f _ {1} (t - 1) + a _ {2} f _ {2} (t - 1) ] \\textcircled {1}} \\\\ {a _ {1} y _ {1} (t) + a _ {2} y _ {2} (t)} & {= a _ {1} [ f _ {1} (2 t) + f _ {1} (t - 1) ] + a _ {2} [ f _ {2} (2 t) + f _ {2} (t - 1) ] \\textcircled {2}} \\\\ {H [ f (t - t _ {0}) ]} & {= f (2 t - t _ {0}) + f (t - 1 - t _ {0}) \\textcircled {3}} \\\\ {y (t - t _ {0})} & {= f [ 2 (t - t _ {0}) ] + f (t - t _ {0} - 1) \\textcircled {4}} \\\\ {\\textcircled {1}} & {= \\textcircled {2}, \\textcircled {3} \\neq \\textcircled {4} \\mathrm{故为线性,时变系统}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            171,
            217,
            873,
            423
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "令t=1 则 $y(1)=f(2)+f(0)$ 说明存在响应超前激励情况\n故非因果\n由于n响应与其它时刻输入有关，故记忆永远",
        "bbox": [
            205,
            427,
            889,
            549
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $\\vert f(t)\\vert\\leq M$ 则 $\\vert y(t)\\vert=\\vert f(2t)+f(t-1)\\vert\\leq\\vert f(2t)\\vert+\\vert f(t-1)\\vert=2\\vert f(t)\\vert\\leq2M$ 故余心稳定",
        "bbox": [
