            421,
            150
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 判断 $f(t)$ 是否为时不变的;",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            157,
            438,
            175
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) $x(t)$ 如图所示, 画出 $f(t)$ 的图像。",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            182,
            487,
            200
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "12) $H[x(t-t_{0})]$ $=\\left|x(t-t_{0})-x(t-2-t_{0})\\right|$",
        "bbox": [
            78,
            230,
            344,
            296
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$f\\left( {t - {tw}}\\right)  = 1x\\left( {t - {tw}}\\right)  - x\\left( {t - {tw} - 2}\\right)$ ④",
        "bbox": [
            82,
            296,
            349,
            340
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "③ = ④ 时不变，补充",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            332,
            292,
            370
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
